The  file contains a list of the shells on the system.  It can be
used in conjunction with the Hesiod domain and the  map  as  con‐
trolled  by  For each shell a single line should be present, con‐
sisting of the shell’s path, relative to root.  A hash  indicates
the  beginning  of a comment; subsequent characters up to the end
of the line are not interpreted by the routines which search  the
file.   Blank  lines  are  also ignored.  The file resides in The
